  "details": "The sorting options on the Group Events page appear to be reversed.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open a VRChat Group.\n\n2. Go to the Events tab.\n\n3. Set the display filter to \"Past\".\n\n4. Change the sorting between \"Newest First\" and \"Oldest First\".\n\nExpected behavior:\n\n- \"Newest First\" should display the most recent past events first.\n\n- \"Oldest First\" should display the oldest past events first.\n\nActual behavior:\n\nThe results appear to be the opposite:\n\n- When \"Newest First\" is selected, older events are shown first.\n\n- When \"Oldest First\" is selected, newer events are shown first.\n\nI have attached screenshots showing the issue. In my case, events from January/February appear before June events when \"Newest First\" is selected, while June events appear first when \"Oldest First\" is selected.",
